        "title": "Jing guang puthe hei kandih",
        "credits": {
          "translator": null,
          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1. Jing guang puthe hei kandih hei,",
            "Liam guang puthe jingmei lim @&4;",
            "Aphai ding khou ganchuanga @&4,",
            "Hou dat mak khe.",
            "",
            "Chorus:",
            "Pouhta thuan e alung kapum,",
            "Patlou duni hei kandih hei;",
            "Nkha lou o ai kam thao the,",
            "Tingkauh ramkhou jingguang puthe,",
            "Hei kandih hei.",
            "",
            "2. Ai mang dutat akai khou @&4,",
            "Kamuat guang the rianramei @&4;",
            "Khaloumei mak champan guai @&4,",
            "Nangbang ata.",
            "",
            "3. Jingpui ram e hei kandih hei,",
            "Thut phui lou o kapmei mikdui;",
            "Timan lou o kandih jangsi,",
            "Akhou @&4 na.",
            "",
            "4. Kapmei khuan @&4 hei kandih khou,",
            "Chu dat lak khe neilamei @&4;",
            "Tingkauh ram thang naidat lak khe,",
            "Mikdui kei mei.",
            "",
            "5. Hei kandih hei rianramei @&4,",
            "Gan lou dulana juan guang the;",
            "Tingkauh ram thang chana thiu le,",
            "Suanrei guai le.",
            "Favourite song: Acham Kamei"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
